# UDP log sink (debugnet-compatible).
#
# Copy this file to ux0:data/asphalt5/netlog.txt on the Vita and set `ip` to
# the machine that should receive the log. Delete the file to turn the sink
# back off. No rebuild is needed either way.
#
# On the receiving machine:
#   nc -u -l 18194        # macOS / BSD
#   nc -u -l -p 18194     # Linux
#
# Format is `key value`, one per line. Only `ip` and `port` are recognised;
# every other line -- these comments included -- is skipped.

ip 192.168.3.10
port 18194
